# Build machine (Linux x86-64) packages that compile the Android wheels. build_runtime.py downloads them by hash into
# a local wheelhouse and gives cibuildwheel only that wheelhouse (PIP_NO_INDEX), so no build fetches anything else.
#
# cibuildwheel 4.3.5's own Android tools, at the versions of its constraints-python314.txt (cibuildwheel installs
# them with that file as a constraint, so the lock below is resolved with it too):
